# Nothing is ignored by path.
#
# maps/phuninteriors used to be excluded here while it was borrowed space
# standing in for the purpose-built map. All twenty cells (87..91 x 46..49) are
# ours now and the rooms do not exist without them, so the whole map is
# tracked. See .gitattributes -- the lotpacks, lotheaders and chunkdata are
# binary and must not be line-ending converted.

# GIMP sources for icon.png, poster.png and the tileset. Large, regenerable by
# export, and of no use to anyone cloning the repo -- xclude keeps them out of
# the Workshop staging trees for the same reason.
Docs/images/

# Scratch backups left by the tile and map editors. xclude also drops these, so
# a stray one cannot reach a Workshop build.
*.bak
*.orig
*.tmp
